-- ---- s 113J(1): "Every company having more than 50 members must keep an index ... unless the register of members is in such a form as to constitute in itself an index" ----
-- arguments: (the number of members) (the register constitutes in itself an index)
#ASSERT `s 113J(1) the company must keep an index of the names or titles of its members` 50 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 113J(1) the company must keep an index of the names or titles of its members` 50 TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 113J(1) the company must keep an index of the names or titles of its members` 51 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 113J(1) the company must keep an index of the names or titles of its members` 51 TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 113J(1) the company must keep an index of the names or titles of its members` 0 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 113J(1) the company must keep an index of the names or titles of its members` 400 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 113J(2): "within 14 days after the date on which any alteration is made in the register": the register altered on 1 January 2023, the last day is 15 January 2023
#ASSERT `s 113J(2) the last day for making the alteration in the index` (Date 1 1 2023) EQUALS Date 15 1 2023
#ASSERT `s 113J(2) the last day for making the alteration in the index` (Date 20 12 2022) EQUALS Date 3 1 2023
#ASSERT `s 113J(2) the last day for making the alteration in the index` (Date 17 2 2023) EQUALS Date 3 3 2023
-- arguments: (the answer of s 113J(1)) (the register altered on) (the index altered on)
#ASSERT `s 113J(2) the company made the necessary alteration in the index within 14 days` (JUST TRUE) (Date 1 1 2023) (Date 15 1 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 113J(2) the company made the necessary alteration in the index within 14 days` (JUST TRUE) (Date 1 1 2023) (Date 16 1 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 113J(2) the company made the necessary alteration in the index within 14 days` (JUST TRUE) (Date 1 1 2023) (Date 1 1 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 113J(2) the company made the necessary alteration in the index within 14 days` (JUST TRUE) (Date 1 1 2023) (Date 31 12 2022) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 113J(2) the company made the necessary alteration in the index within 14 days` (JUST FALSE) (Date 1 1 2023) (Date 5 1 2023) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 113J(2) the company made the necessary alteration in the index within 14 days` NOTHING (Date 1 1 2023) (Date 5 1 2023) EQUALS NOTHING
#TRACE `s 113J(2) the company must alter the index within 14 days after the alteration of the register (duty)` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `s 113J(2) the company alters the index of members' names` AT 14
#TRACE `s 113J(2) the company must alter the index within 14 days after the alteration of the register (duty)` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 15)
#ASSERT `s 113J(3) the index must include the same detail of the person's name or title` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 113J(3) the index must include the same detail of the person's name or title` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 113J(4) and (4A): arguments (a restriction imposed by regulations under section 120A applies)
#ASSERT `s 113J(4) the index must at all times be kept available for inspection at the same place as the register, subject to s 113J(4A)` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 113J(4) the index must at all times be kept available for inspection at the same place as the register, subject to s 113J(4A)` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
