#ASSERT `s 113J(5) the person commits an offence` TRUE Company NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 113J(5) the person commits an offence` TRUE Director (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 113J(5) the person commits an offence` TRUE Director (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 113J(5) the person commits an offence` TRUE `Company secretary` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 113J(5) the person commits an offence` TRUE Member (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
